// Package-local stdlib safety evidence for 0.5.14.
//
// This fixture is intentionally metadata-heavy: the functional adversarial
// coverage lives in the package tests named by docs/STDLIB_SAFETY_CONTRACTS.md.
// scripts/stdlib-safety-audit.sh requires one checked-native marker for every
// checked-native std package and one exclusion marker for every unsafe-boundary
// std package, so broad family tests cannot hide package-level claim drift.

